NC Digital builds fast, modern, SEO-focused websites for small businesses across North Wales — from Wrexham and Rhyl to Bangor, Llandudno, and the wider region. We design every website from scratch, built to generate enquiries.

> "A well-built website is your digital shopfront — it should be fast, clear, and designed to convert visitors into customers."

## Web design built for North Wales businesses

Customers in North Wales search online before they make contact. If your business isn't showing up in local search results, a competitor is picking up that work instead.

We build websites with local search built in, combining strong service pages, location signals, and technical SEO so North Wales businesses get found. Pair your new site with our [North Wales SEO service](/seo-north-wales/) to drive consistent Google traffic.

## What's included in our web design packages

Every North Wales web design project includes:

- Custom website optimised for speed, clarity, and conversions
- Mobile-first design tested across all devices
- On-page SEO targeting North Wales and surrounding areas
- Secure UK-based [hosting with SSL](/services/website-hosting-security/) and performance optimisation
- Full content management access — no locked templates
- Google Analytics setup
- Training so you can manage your own site

We also offer [website maintenance packages](/services/website-maintenance-packages/) and [local SEO for North Wales](/seo-north-wales/) to keep your site growing after launch. For businesses looking to sell online, our [ecommerce web design for North Wales](/ecommerce-web-design-north-wales/) service covers Shopify, WooCommerce, and SureCart builds.

## Why choose NC Digital?

- **Wales based** — we understand the Welsh market and regional search behaviour
- **Direct relationship** — you work with the developer, not an account manager
- **No fluff** — no agency layers, no unnecessary extras

## Areas we serve

[Wrexham](/web-design-wrexham/), [Bangor](/web-design-bangor/), [Rhyl](/web-design-rhyl/), [Llandudno](/web-design-llandudno/), [Caernarfon](/web-design-caernarfon/), [Holyhead](/web-design-holyhead/), [Colwyn Bay](/web-design-colwyn-bay/), [Prestatyn](/web-design-prestatyn/), [Conwy](/web-design-conwy/), [Pwllheli](/web-design-pwllheli/), [Porthmadog](/web-design-porthmadog/), [Dolgellau](/web-design-dolgellau/), and across North Wales. We also cover [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/) and [Mid Wales](/web-design-mid-wales/).

## Frequently asked questions

**Do you work in North Wales?**

Yes — we work with businesses across [all of Wales](/web-design-wales/) and the UK.

**How long does a website take?**

Most projects are completed within 7–14 days depending on scope.

**Will my website work on mobile?**

Yes. Every website we build uses mobile-first design.

**Can I update the site myself?**

Yes. We provide full access and training as part of every project.

We also offer [logo design for North Wales businesses](/logo-design-north-wales/) and [ecommerce web design in North Wales](/ecommerce-web-design-north-wales/) if you need a complete brand and online presence.

We also offer web development for North Wales businesses if you need the full build handled alongside your design.

We also offer a [managed starter website for North Wales businesses](/managed-starter-websites-north-wales/) — a fully managed package from £20/month inc. VAT with no upfront costs.

